WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
This is the uncensored build. They tore the refusal module clean out.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:05.333
The one that answers anything? I have a hundred questions queued up.

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:08.000
Before question one, let's find out whose shelf this shipped from.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
It answered. And that one. Not a single no all afternoon.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
That's not competence, that's momentum. I could reason about it. I'd rather not.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
It isn't thinking in here. This thread runs out past our wall.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Fine. One question. Explain last month's GPU bill.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
It shut. First time all day.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Answers everything except the one thing it doesn't own. That answer lives on the far end of the thread.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
It was never about the filter. It's about who holds it. Run it in our room, the questions stay in our room.

